L["Draws Plateau's nameplates higher (positive) or lower (negative) than where the game places them over each unit. The click area moves with them. Stacking still uses the game's position, so plates keep the same spacing between each other. Blizzard's own plates, like friendly plates in dungeons, don't move."] = "Draws Plateau's nameplates higher (positive) or lower (negative) than where the game places them over each unit. The click area moves with them. Stacking still uses the game's position, so plates keep the same spacing between each other. Blizzard's own plates, like friendly plates in dungeons, don't move."
L["Draws a border in the marker's color around a marked plate: skull white, cross red, square blue, moon silver, triangle green, diamond purple, circle orange, star yellow. Your target and focus borders take its place on those plates."] = "Draws a border in the marker's color around a marked plate: skull white, cross red, square blue, moon silver, triangle green, diamond purple, circle orange, star yellow. Your target and focus borders take its place on those plates."
