L["Off shows only removable buffs: Magic buffs that can be purged or stolen, and enrages. On shows every buff on the enemy except important ones and ones you cast. Hide boss auras, Hide permanent buffs, Maximum aura duration and Maximum icons still apply. Buffs the game flags as important appear under Important auras instead."] = "Off shows only removable buffs: Magic buffs that can be purged or stolen, and enrages. On shows every buff on the enemy except important ones and ones you cast. Hide boss auras, Hide permanent buffs, Maximum aura duration and Maximum icons still apply. Buffs the game flags as important appear under Important auras instead."
