L["Off: friendly plates put the raid icon where the Raid target icon page says. On: friendly plates use the position below, and moving the icon on the Friendly nameplates page's preview no longer moves it on enemy plates. Size and opacity still follow the Raid target icon page."] = "Off: friendly plates put the raid icon where the Raid target icon page says. On: friendly plates use the position below, and moving the icon on the Friendly nameplates page's preview no longer moves it on enemy plates. Size and opacity still follow the Raid target icon page."
