L["The look of Plateau's settings window and pop-ups. Workbench is flat charcoal with a green accent; Artisan Ledger is walnut and brass with a serif title face; Lixard Classic is near-black, square and gold. Your nameplates don't change. Takes effect after a reload."] = "The look of Plateau's settings window and pop-ups. Workbench is flat charcoal with a green accent; Artisan Ledger is walnut and brass with a serif title face; Lixard Classic is near-black, square and gold. Your nameplates don't change. Takes effect after a reload."
L["The look of the corner brackets."] = "The look of the corner brackets."
L["The master switch for Blizzard's elite/rare/boss badge. The four switches below choose which classifications get it. Separate from Plateau's own enemy-type coloring."] = "The master switch for Blizzard's elite/rare/boss badge. The four switches below choose which classifications get it. Separate from Plateau's own enemy-type coloring."
L["The master switch for all threat coloring below. This color itself is the bad/wrong-aggro state: for a tank, an enemy you don't have; for damage or a healer, an enemy that has you. Only checked in combat."] = "The master switch for all threat coloring below. This color itself is the bad/wrong-aggro state: for a tank, an enemy you don't have; for damage or a healer, an enemy that has you. Only checked in combat."
L["The master switch for enemy nameplates. Off hides every one of them. This controls nameplate visibility."] = "The master switch for enemy nameplates. Off hides every one of them. This controls nameplate visibility."
