L["The name over your target's head shows even when names over heads are turned off above."] = "The name over your target's head shows even when names over heads are turned off above."
L["The out-of-combat look only applies inside dungeons, raids and delves, so open-world enemies look normal."] = "The out-of-combat look only applies inside dungeons, raids and delves, so open-world enemies look normal."
